      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Filer%2C_Idaho"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Since 1916, Filer has hosted the Twin Falls County Fair and Rodeo, also called the Magic Valley Stampede.",
